
### Get all books
GET http://localhost:5035/books

### Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:5035/books/1

### Create a book
POST http://localhost:5035/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "The Art of Computer Programming",
    "authorName": "Donald Knuth",
    "price": 89.99,
    "releaseDate": "1968-01-01",
    "genre": "Computer Science"
}

### Update a book
PUT http://localhost:5035/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Clean Code - Updated",
    "authorName": "Robert C. Martin",
    "price": 49.99,
    "releaseDate": "2008-08-01",
    "genre": "Software Engineering"
}

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:5035/books/1




### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:5035/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userName": "admin",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Login as regular user
POST http://localhost:5035/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userName": "user",
    "password": "1234"
}

### Login with incorrect credentials
POST http://localhost:5035/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userName": "admin",
    "password": "wrong"
}


###
GET http://localhost:5035/me HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer your-token